msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Browse and stream FORMED with your own subscription"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Unofficial client for FORMED (formed.org). Signs in with your own FORMED account using the service's standard OpenID Connect device flow, then browses the catalogue and streams content. Playback only - this add-on does not download or record. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by FORMED or the Augustine Institute."
msgstr ""

